/* zh-SG translations for "ch4" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 4": "第四章",
  "Payday": "发薪日",
  "Chapter 5 — Ubin Camp": "第五章 · 乌敏岛营",
  "Sunday closing time at Uncle Ong's café. Chairs up on the tables, the floor still wet. He slides an envelope across the counter.": "礼拜天打烊。王伯的咖啡店椅子都翻到桌上了，地板还湿湿的。他把一个信封从柜台推过来。",
  "Four weekends washing cups. $480. Count it. Then count again. Nobody else will count for you.": "洗了四个周末的杯子。$480。数一数。再数一遍。没人会帮你数的。",
  "First pay ah, very dangerous. Feels like a lot. It's exactly $480.": "第一份薪水啊，最危险。感觉好多。其实就是$480而已。",
  "What do you do with the $480?": "这$480怎么安排？",
  "Half to savings, some for fun, some for people you care about. Type it into your notes app.": "一半存起来，一些拿来玩，一些留给在乎的人。打进手机备忘录。",
  "Notes app. Good. Mine is a Khong Guan biscuit tin. Same idea.": "备忘录，好。我的是一个康元饼干铁罐。一样的道理。",
  "Keep it all for fun. You earned it.": "全部拿去玩。自己赚的嘛。",
  "Fun is good. Fun with no plan is how my cousin ended up with six air fryers.": "玩是好事。玩到没计划，我表弟家就有六个气炸锅了。",
  "Put it aside \"for dates\". With... whoever.": "存起来“约会用”。跟……不知道谁。",
  "A date fund for a girl who doesn't exist yet. Budgeting for a daydream.": "为一个还不存在的女生存约会基金。你这是在给白日梦做预算。",
  "That night, lying in bed. A notification: Elise is live.": "那天晚上，你躺在床上。跳出通知：爱丽丝开直播了。",
  "LIVE 🔴 Elise ✨ 2.3k watching": "直播中🔴 爱丽丝 ✨ 2.3千人观看",
  "TOP GIFTER gets a shoutout! 🚀 Rocket = $50": "榜一大哥有专属喊话！🚀 火箭 = $50",
  "thank u babe for the rose!! 🌹 omg who's gonna be my top gifter tonight~": "谢谢宝贝的玫瑰！！🌹 天啊今晚谁会是我的榜一～",
  "Elise is live, smiling at 2,300 people...": "爱丽丝在直播，对着两千三百个人笑……",
  "Close the app. Tomorrow, ask her how rehearsal went.": "关掉app。明天在学校问她排练怎么样。",
  "You... asked about rehearsal? Nobody asks about rehearsal. They ask about the live.": "你……问我排练？从来没人问排练的。大家只会问直播。",
  "It was a disaster, actually. Want to hear? It's so bad.": "其实超惨的。你要听吗？真的很惨。",
  "Send one $5 heart. Just to be nice.": "送一个$5的爱心。意思一下。",
  "thanks for the heart, {name}! 💕": "谢谢{name}的爱心！💕",
  "She said your name. And 400 other names. That's the job.": "她念了你的名字。还有另外四百个名字。那是她的工作。",
  "Rocket. Rocket. Rocket. Become TOP GIFTER.": "火箭。火箭。火箭。冲上榜一。",
  "omg TOP GIFTER!! thank u uh... (squints) ...{name}??": "天啊榜一！！谢谢……呃（眯眼看屏幕）……{name}？？",
  "At school she walks right past you. Without the username, she doesn't know your face.": "在学校，她从你身边直接走过去。没有了用户名，她认不出你的脸。",
  "BAD END #19 — Top Gifter of Nothing": "坏结局 #19 · 什么都没换到的榜一",
  "You paid for attention and got exactly that: three seconds of your name, read off a screen. Bought attention is a receipt, not a relationship.": "你花钱买关注，也确实买到了：三秒钟，你的名字被念了一次。买来的关注是一张收据，不是一段关系。",
  "Saturday, the sports shop at Jurong Point. Kavya asked you to come \"for a second opinion\".": "礼拜六，裕廊坊的运动用品店。卡维娅说要你来“给点意见”。",
  "These spikes. $240. Nationals in six weeks, and mine are literally falling apart.": "这双钉鞋，$240。还有六个礼拜就全国赛了，我那双真的快烂了。",
  "You just got paid right? Buy for me? ...Kidding. Mostly.": "你刚领薪水对吧？买给我？……开玩笑的啦。大概。",
  "Kavya looks at the spikes, then at you...": "卡维娅看看钉鞋，又看看你……",
  "\"$240 is half my pay, cannot. But I can help you look for second-hand ones, or come with you to ask Coach about team gear.\"": "“$240是我半个月薪水，不行。不过我可以帮你找二手的，或者陪你去问教练有没有队里的装备。”",
  "...Okay, didn't expect a real answer. Coach has a gear fund. I totally forgot. You're kind of useful.": "……哦，没想到你会认真回答。教练那边有装备基金，我完全忘了。你还蛮有用的嘛。",
  "Buy them. You want to see her smile.": "买了。你想看她笑。",
  "Wait, serious? ...Okay. Thanks. Um. Thanks.": "等等，真的哦？……好。谢谢。呃……谢谢。",
  "She holds the bag like it's slightly too heavy.": "她提着那个袋子，好像有点太重了。",
  "The smile lasted four seconds. Your wallet will remember for four months.": "笑容维持了四秒。你的钱包会记四个月。",
  "\"Haha, no way. Buy your own stuff.\" (Walk off.)": "“哈哈，想太多。自己的东西自己买。”（转身就走）",
  "I said kidding. No need to be weird about it.": "我都说开玩笑了。不用这样吧。",
  "On the way out, the phone shop. The new model, $998. Huge sign: ONLY $83/MONTH! 0% FOR 12 MONTHS!*": "出来的时候经过手机店。新款，$998。大大的牌子：每月只需$83！12个月0利息！*",
  "*Late fee $30. After month 12, interest at 26.8% a year.": "*迟缴费$30。第12个月后，年利率26.8%。",
  "Your current phone works fine...": "你现在的手机明明还很好用……",
  "Read the asterisk. Walk out. Your phone works.": "看清楚那个星号。走人。你的手机还能用。",
  "$83 a month is twelve weekends of washing cups. For a better camera.": "一个月$83，等于洗十二个周末的杯子。就为了一个好一点的镜头。",
  "Sign up. It's only $83.": "签了。才$83嘛。",
  "Not \"only $83\". It's $998, paid till next year. Buy now, pay later is just... later.": "不是“才$83”。是$998，一直付到明年。先买后付，只是“后”而已。",
  "Dinner at home. Steamed fish, kangkong, the TV on Channel 8 with no one watching.": "家里吃晚饭。清蒸鱼、马来风光，电视开着第八波道，没人在看。",
  "So. First pay ah. Your father and I were saying... some families give a bit back to the house.": "那个……第一份薪水哦。我跟你爸在讲……有些家庭会拿一点回来给家里。",
  "No pressure. I gave my mother my whole first pay packet. She cried. I cried. Then I was broke for a month.": "没有压力啦。我以前第一份薪水整包给我妈。她哭，我也哭。然后我穷了一整个月。",
  "Your parents are being careful about it...": "爸妈讲得很小心……",
  "Give $50 for the house. \"Thanks for seventeen years of rice.\"": "拿$50给家里。“谢谢你们养了我十七年。”",
  "We put it towards your school fees. ...Wah. So grown-up already.": "我们拿去帮你付学费。……哇，长大了哦。",
  "\"It's my money. I worked for it.\"": "“那是我的钱。我自己赚的。”",
  "It is. You're right. ...We worked for this flat also. Just saying.": "是啦，你说得对。……这间组屋我们也是做工换来的。随便说说而已。",
  "Give everything. Every dollar. The guilt is heavy.": "全部给。一块都不留。内疚太重了。",
  "Aiyo, no! We said a bit only. Keep most of it. Learning to manage it is the whole point.": "哎哟，不用啦！说了一点点就好。大部分你留着。学会管钱才是重点。",
  "Thursday Open Night at Uncle Ong's café: a borrowed amp, a wall of pinned-up drawings, a sign-up sheet on a clipboard. You're on shift.": "王伯咖啡店的星期四开放之夜：借来的音箱，一整面贴满画的墙，夹板上一张报名表。你在当班。",
  "Evening. Ollie. I run this, sort of. Mostly I carry the amp.": "晚上好。我是奥利。这个活动算是我办的吧。大部分时间我在搬音箱。",
  "Hey! I saw your story, so I came! Okay, real talk, that brownie was amazing.": "嘿！我看到你的限时动态就来了！好，说真的，那个布朗尼太好吃了。",
  "She pays, then slides a five-dollar note across the counter to Uncle Ong. He looks at it like it might be a test.": "她付了钱，又把一张五块钱推到柜台另一边给王伯。王伯看着那张钞票，好像这是什么考验。",
  "Girl, what's this for? You paid already.": "妹妹，这个做什么的？你已经付了啊。",
  "It's a tip? For the service?": "小费？谢谢你的服务？",
  "Did that my first week. Bit of a nightmare, to be honest. The chicken rice uncle chased me down the road with my change.": "我第一个星期也这样做过。说实话，有点惨。鸡饭安哥追着我跑了一条街，要把零钱还我。",
  "Restaurants here add a ten percent service charge, then GST on top. Hawker stalls have neither, and nobody expects a tip. It's either built in or it's not a thing.": "这里的餐厅会加百分之十服务费，再加消费税。小贩中心两样都没有，也没人期待小费。要么已经算进去，要么就根本没这回事。",
  "Oh my gosh. Uncle Ong, I'm so sorry. I wasn't trying to be weird about it.": "天啊。王伯，真的对不起。我不是故意要搞得很奇怪。",
  "Never mind. Put it in the Open Night jar. Then Ollie can buy new strings and stop complaining.": "没事啦。放进开放之夜的罐子。这样奥利就可以买新琴弦，不用再抱怨了。",
  "So you work here? For money? My dad gives me eighty a week and I keep all of it. My mom says it's practice for real life.": "所以你在这里打工？赚钱？我爸每个星期给我八十块，我全部自己留着。我妈说这是在练习过真实人生。",
  "Wait, you give some of your pay to your MOM? Why? Isn't she supposed to give it to you?": "等一下，你把薪水分一些给你妈？为什么？不是应该她给你吗？",
  "She gets $80 a week and was surprised you give part of your pay at home.": "她一个星期有八十块零用钱，听到你把一部分薪水交给家里，很惊讶。",
  "She's genuinely asking.": "她是真心在问。",
  "Explain, no judging: \"Lots of families here do it. It's thanks for the rice. Yours is practice, mine is belonging. Both okay.\"": "解释，不评判：“这里很多家庭都这样。是谢谢家里的饭。你那种是练习独立，我这种是一家人。两种都OK。”",
  "Huh. Belonging. Okay, I like that. I'm gonna ask my mom what she gave her parents. I have literally no idea.": "嗯。一家人。好，我喜欢这个说法。我要问我妈她以前给她爸妈什么。我完全不知道耶。",
  "She asks Uncle Ong if she can help stack chairs at closing instead. He says yes before she finishes the sentence.": "她问王伯，打烊的时候她可不可以帮忙叠椅子。她话还没说完，王伯就说好了。",
  "She listened, apologised to Uncle Ong, and stayed to stack chairs.": "她听进去了，向王伯道歉，还留下来帮忙叠椅子。",
  "\"Must be nice to be rich.\"": "“有钱真好。”",
  "...Yeah. Okay. We're not, really. But I get why it looks like that.": "……嗯。好吧。我们其实没有很有钱。但我懂为什么看起来像。",
  "She asked a real question. You answered a stereotype.": "她问的是真问题。你回的是刻板印象。",
  "\"Eighty a week?! Teach me how to get that from my dad.\"": "“一个星期八十块？！教我怎么跟我爸拿。”",
  "Step one: be born in Texas. Step two... actually, I don't know. I've never thought about it.": "第一步：在德州出生。第二步……其实我也不知道。我从来没想过。",
  "Later, a nervous Sec 4 boy plays one song on Ollie's guitar. Ollie listens with his arms folded, then nods.": "后来，一个紧张的中四男生用奥利的吉他弹了一首歌。奥利交叉双臂听完，点了点头。",
  "Not bad, that.": "还不赖。",
  "The boy looks crushed. Ollie notices.": "男生看起来很受打击。奥利注意到了。",
  "No, that's... where I'm from, that's a standing ovation. Come back next Thursday. Bring a second song.": "不是，那个……在我老家，这已经算起立鼓掌了。下个星期四再来，带第二首歌。",
  "Same goes for you, by the way. If you ever want a slot for {passion}, it's there. No pressure.": "对了，你也一样。哪天想要一个时段来玩{passion}，位置一直都在。没压力。",
  "He lends the boy his own guitar for the week. You find out later that he rents one room in Tiong Bahru, and the amp is borrowed too.": "他把自己的吉他借给那个男生一个星期。后来你才知道，他在中峇鲁只租了一个房间，连音箱也是借的。",
  "He lent his own guitar to a kid he'd just met.": "他把自己的吉他借给一个刚认识的孩子。",
  "Saturday night, the void deck court. Haziq's futsal kakis are one short. A new guy in a yellow jersey has already scored twice and hugged everyone, including a cat.": "星期六晚上，组屋楼下的球场。哈齐克的足球kaki少一个人。一个穿黄色球衣的新面孔已经进了两球，还抱了每一个人，包括一只猫。",
  "¡Hermano! ¡Qué bueno! Did you SEE that?! Mateo. Mateo Tan Rojas. Yes, Tan. Long story.": "¡Hermano！¡Qué bueno！你有看到吗？！马特奥。马特奥·陈·罗哈斯。对，姓陈。说来话长。",
  "He knew everyone's name in ten minutes, including the cat's.": "他十分钟就记住了每个人的名字，包括那只猫的。",
  "He moved from Medellín last year. His dad's from Bedok. Bro plays like he got four legs.": "他去年从麦德林搬来的。他爸是勿洛人。这家伙踢球好像有四条腿。",
  "The new goalkeeper, a skinny Sec 3 kid, makes a save. Mateo charges over for a bear hug. The kid flinches and steps back.": "新来的守门员，一个瘦瘦的中三男生，扑出一球。马特奥冲过去要熊抱他。男生缩了一下，往后退。",
  "He went in to hug the new goalkeeper, who flinched.": "他冲过去要抱新来的守门员，对方缩了一下。",
  "Mateo's arms are still out. The kid is looking at the floor.": "马特奥的手臂还张着。那个男生盯着地板。",
  "Quietly, at the water cooler: \"Not everyone's a hugger, bro. Ask first. 'Can I hug you?' Two seconds only.\"": "在饮水机旁小声说：“兄弟，不是每个人都喜欢抱的。先问。‘我可以抱你吗？’两秒钟而已。”",
  "Dios mío. In Medellín everybody hugs. My abuela hugs the postman. ...But he's not my abuela, sí.": "Dios mío。在麦德林大家都抱来抱去。我阿布埃拉连邮差都抱。……可是他不是我阿布埃拉，sí。",
  "Next save, Mateo stops two metres away.": "下一次扑救，马特奥在两米外停下来。",
  "Can I hug you? I'm asking now. Look at me, growing.": "我可以抱你吗？我现在有问哦。看我，在成长。",
  "The goalkeeper laughs and offers a fist bump instead. Mateo celebrates it like a World Cup final.": "守门员笑了，伸出拳头碰拳。马特奥庆祝得像赢了世界杯决赛。",
  "He started asking before hugging.": "他开始在拥抱前先问了。",
  "Laugh it off. \"Relax lah, he's just friendly.\"": "一笑带过：“放轻松啦，他只是热情。”",
  "The goalkeeper doesn't come back the next week.": "那个守门员下个星期没再来。",
  "Friendly is a feeling. Whether a hug is welcome is the other person's call.": "热情是一种感觉。拥抱受不受欢迎，是对方说了算。",
  "Sunday. Mum sends you to visit Ah Ma, one block away. She's folding plastic bags from the market into tiny triangles.": "礼拜天。妈妈叫你去看住在隔壁座的阿嬷。她正把巴刹带回来的塑料袋折成小三角形。",
  "You buy bubble tea? Fifteen dollar? Aiyoh. Fifteen dollar, Ah Ma can eat three days.": "你买珍珠奶茶？十五块？哎哟。十五块，阿嬷可以吃三天。",
  "She holds her phone at arm's length and jabs at it like it owes her money.": "她把手机拿得老远，用手指戳屏幕，好像手机欠她钱一样。",
  "Ah Ma's phone is winning.": "阿嬷的手机占了上风。",
  "Pull up a stool. \"Show me what you're trying to do.\"": "拉张凳子坐下。“给我看看你要做什么。”",
  "The CC phone class teacher say must practise. You come every Sunday, I practise on you.": "民众俱乐部手机班的老师说要多练习。你每个礼拜天来，我就拿你来练。",
  "\"Just give me, Ah Ma. Faster.\"": "“阿嬷，给我啦，比较快。”",
  "Faster for you lah. For me, still don't know how.": "对你来说快啦。对我来说，还是不会。",
  "The kueh stall at the Seri Bayu hawker centre. The girl behind the counter is doing sums on a calculator while serving three customers.": "斯里巴尤小贩中心的糕点摊。柜台后面的女生一边招呼三个客人，一边按计算机算账。",
  "Fifteen-dollar bubble tea? That's three plates of chicken rice. You're not buying a drink, you're buying a photo. I'm Chloe. Kueh lapis, two dollars.": "十五块的珍珠奶茶？那是三盘鸡饭。你买的不是饮料，是一张照片。我是可儿。千层糕，两块钱。",
  "An old aunty shuffles up. Chloe hands her two pieces of ondeh-ondeh, writes nothing down, and waves her off.": "一位老安娣慢慢走过来。可儿递给她两粒椰丝球，什么都没记，就挥手让她走了。",
  "The aunty didn't pay.": "那位安娣没有付钱。",
  "Ask, quietly, about the aunty.": "小声问她那位安娣的事。",
  "Mdm. Rokiah. Her pension comes on the 5th. Some months it doesn't stretch. Don't tell my dad. ...Okay, he knows. He pretends he doesn't.": "罗琪雅太太。她的养老金五号才进来，有些月份撑不到月底。别跟我爸说。……好啦，他知道。他假装不知道。",
  "You saw the tab she never collects.": "你看到了她从来不收的那笔账。",
  "Ask how she prices a kueh.": "问她一块糕怎么定价。",
  "Rice flour, coconut, pandan, gas, time. Then I round down for students. Want to see the spreadsheet?": "米粉、椰子、班兰、煤气、时间。然后给学生再算便宜一点。要看我的表格吗？",
  "She walked you through her costing.": "她带你看了她的成本计算。",
  "\"Must be nice. Free kueh for your friends.\"": "“真好啊。朋友吃糕都免费。”",
  "She's not my friend. She's a customer. ...Who doesn't pay. Never mind.": "她不是我朋友，她是客人。……不付钱的客人。算了。",
  "{n:kaede} spends on gear and food \"because life is now\". {n:hina} saves every cent. You?": "{n:kaede}把钱花在装备和吃的上，“因为人生就是现在”。{n:hina}每一分都存起来。你呢？",
  "\"I see it a bit differently. What does spending on stuff you love give you?\"": "“我看法有点不一样。花钱在你喜欢的东西上，给你的是什么？”",
  "\"Save first. Small treats, big buffer.\"": "“先存。小小犒赏自己，大大一笔备用金。”",
  "\"Save a fixed bit first, then enjoy the rest without guilt.\"": "“先存固定的一份，剩下的就放心享受。”",
  "\"Enjoy it now. Only young once.\"": "“现在就享受。年轻只有一次。”",
  "\"Spend everything you earn? That's just bad with money lah.\"": "“赚多少花多少？那就是不会管钱啦。”",
  "A free evening. Where does it go?": "一个空闲的晚上。你怎么过？",
  "Study, properly, phone in the other room.": "认真读书，手机放在另一个房间。",
  "An hour on {passion}. Just for you.": "花一小时在{passion}上。只为了你自己。",
  "A run at the park connector, a proper dinner, bed by eleven.": "去公园连道跑个步，好好吃顿晚饭，十一点前上床。",
  "Kopi with Haziq. He has been weird lately.": "和哈齐克喝杯咖啡（kopi）。他最近怪怪的。",
  "Call {her}. Again.": "打给{her}。又打。",
  "Your Wallet bar moved this chapter. So did your Love IQ. Funny how those two keep holding hands.": "这一章你的钱包条动了，恋爱智商也动了。这两个老是手牵手，真奇妙。"
});
